# Negosud API

RESTful API for a wine e-commerce business, connected to MySQL.

## Features

- ASP.NET back-end
- Products, stock and orders
- Serves the desktop client and the web shop

## Tech Stack

- C# / .NET

## Getting Started

```bash
git clone https://github.com/ghostland-dev/negosud-api-aspnet.git
cd negosud-api-aspnet
dotnet restore
dotnet run
```

